2. COMMERCIAL MODEL (V1)

   2.1 First 1,000 verified users receive the complete V1 desktop product free.
       Verification is tied to a unique verified email entitlement.

   2.2 After the first 1,000 verified users:
         - a useful Free edition remains available, and
         - the Full edition of the 1.x series is licensed for a one-time
           payment of USD 29 (one active device per verified email/license,
           with legitimate device deactivation/transfer).

   2.3 There is no subscription, no usage meter, no advertising, and no cloud
       requirement for statistical computation.

